    "documentation": "Registers a **chart alert condition** (the user still creates the alert from the TradingView UI).\n\n| Parameter | Notes |\n|-----------|--------|\n| **condition** | `series bool` — when `true`, the condition is satisfied for that bar (subject to alert frequency). |\n| **title** | **const string** — must be known at compile time (not `series string`). Concatenating only **string literals** is OK; mixing in `str.tostring(...)`, series values, or other expressions is rejected (**CE10123**). |\n| **message** | **const string** — same rules as `title`. |\n| **freq** | Optional frequency / alert options string (see TradingView reference for allowed values). |\n\nOfficial wording: *const string* is required where TradingView expects compile-time string arguments."
